-MemCellType: memristor
-ProcessNode: 22
-AccessType: Diode                // Engaging optimized crossbar solver
-SelectorType: UserDefined
-CellArea (F^2): 4.0               // Targeted idealized cross-point area
-CellAspectRatio: 1.0
-ResistanceOnAtReadVoltage (ohm): 100000    // LRS 1.0e5 target
-ResistanceOffAtReadVoltage (ohm): 1000000000 // HRS 1.0e9 target
-ResistanceOnAtWriteVoltage (ohm): 100000
-ResistanceOffAtWriteVoltage (ohm): 1000000000
-ReadLatency (ns): 5
-WriteLatency (ns): 10             // Standardized 10ns write pulse
-ReadEnergy (pJ): 0.2
-WriteEnergy (pJ): 2.0
-ReadMode: current
-WriteMode: voltage
-ReadVoltage (V): 1.4              // Boosted for LOP convergence
-WriteVoltage (V): 2.0
-Nonlinearity (Kr): 1000000       // Selectivity target (10^6)